inside the temporary home and no file goes into `~/Desktop/print-ready/`
(`jr-green-75cc5e54-smoke.txt`). `--proof --workbook` gives
`Storytime-Advantage-L2-Readers-W01-v1_PDFX-1a.pdf`: 6 pages, 594.96 x 841.92 pts, PDF 1.3,
PDF/X-1a:2001, "All checks pass", 18 hits of "PICTURE MISSING" (9 for each reader). `--proof
--a3-color` gives two files of 12 pages each at 841.92 x 1191.12 pts, 9 hits each, and no
`GTS_PDFX` output intent. Observation for the Check task: Chrome writes 0.57 pt more height than
the 1190.55 pt A3 target, as it writes 0.03 pt more for the A4 student book; a later A3 page-size
check needs a small slack.

